# SABOTAGE: T84b (ADR-044 s16.4a, RP-J-14). The masked tier-2 row template must carry NO
# handle in any DOM attribute (mask by omission extended to the client) - a masked <tr> renders
# only its inert "not in your scope" affordance and its metrics, never the handle. Adding a
# data-handle attribute on the masked row leaks a stable per-tenant pseudonym to a viewer not
# entitled to resolve it. Positive control: the NAMED row's resolve_href (which legitimately
# carries the handle for an in-scope viewer) is untouched by this patch.
# APP: samen_web
# TEST_FILES: test/samen/web/fleet_detail_scope_mask_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: RED: a :none-scope viewer (fleet+app role, no account scope) sees NEITHER name nor handle
diff --git a/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/fleet_detail_live.ex b/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/fleet_detail_live.ex
index 169af14..d6f3ba6 100644
--- a/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/fleet_detail_live.ex
+++ b/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/fleet_detail_live.ex
@@ -170,7 +170,7 @@ defmodule Samen.Web.Operator.FleetDetailLive do
               <tbody>
                 <%= for {row, idx} <- Enum.with_index(rows) do %>
                   <%= if row.masked? do %>
-                    <tr id={"cohort-#{kind}-row-#{idx}-masked"} class="cohort-row cohort-row-masked">
+                    <tr id={"cohort-#{kind}-row-#{idx}-masked"} class="cohort-row cohort-row-masked" data-handle={row.handle}>
                       <td class="cohort-name-masked">
                         <span class="masked-affordance">not in your scope</span>
                       </td>
